## TL;DR: Rose Gold Radiant Cut Engagement Ring — Key Facts

**The single most important rule: rose gold masks diamond body color.** Buy G or H — not D, E, or F. In rose gold, G and H grades look identical to D-F face-up. The color premium is [$700–$2,000 per carat](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings?MetalType=rg&ShapeID=Radiant&a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational). Keep that money on carat weight.

